   "roundness": null,
   "text": "requirements live as DIRECTIVES INSIDE prose documents, in RST\nor markdown-via-MyST.\n\nthe decisive test: Kerd's real 14 product docs were copied into a\nSphinx tree and built. Sphinx first refused outright for lack of a\nmaster document; given one, it discovered ZERO needs.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "requirements live as DIRECTIVES INSIDE prose documents, in RST\nor markdown-via-MyST.\n\nthe decisive test: Kerd's real 14 product docs were copied into a\nSphinx tree and built. Sphinx first refused outright for lack of a\nmaster document; given one, it discovered ZERO needs.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
